sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Extractor as Gemini VLM
    participant Engine as Rule Engine
    participant Ledger as Evidence Ledger
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    
    User->>Frontend: Upload Bill, Policy, Rejection
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/claims/analyze
    API->>Extractor: Extract JSON from PDFs
    Extractor-->>API: Returns Structured Data
    API->>Ledger: Initialize Ledger
    API->>Engine: run_all_rules(data, ledger)
    
    Engine->>Engine: Run Tier 0 Gates
    Engine->>Engine: Run Financial Rules
    Engine->>Ledger: record_calculation()
    Ledger-->>Engine: evidence_entry
    Engine-->>API: Returns AnalysisResult
    
    API->>API: enforce_evidence_ledger()
    API->>DB: Save AnalysisRun
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK + JSON
    Frontend-->>User: Display Claim Findings & Appeal
